    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32776" root="غيل" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَائِلَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Rancour, malevolence, malice,</i> or <i>spite,
that is covert,</i> or <i>concealed.</i> (K.) And <i>Evil,</i> or
<i>mischief;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغَالَةٌ</span></b> : (S, K:) thus in the
saying <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ قَلِيلُ الغَائِلَةِ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَغَالَةِ</span></b>  [<i>Such a one
is a person of little evil</i> or <i>mischief</i>]. (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See
also the same word in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غول</span>.

